{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world beneath the surface lurks a variety of monsters waiting for the next adventurer to stumble down. Fight your way back, leveling up your character with unique abilities each run and cash out on all the loot that would hinder your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Dungeon Generation - There are many caves down in the deep, each aimed to keep you on your toes as you navigate back home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based Combat - Plan your next move as you explore and fight your way out of a limited light environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/extras/fa24f6f40a69548dc0f92fa1fe04a8cd.poster.avif?t=1764371847\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/extras/fa24f6f40a69548dc0f92fa1fe04a8cd.webm?t=1764371847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/extras/fa24f6f40a69548dc0f92fa1fe04a8cd.mp4?t=1764371847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiclass Progression - Choose from one of three primary classes and blend between them as you level up your character and unlock new abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/extras/bb6a06076a380f50e1796ff23f168746.poster.avif?t=1764371847\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/extras/bb6a06076a380f50e1796ff23f168746.webm?t=1764371847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/extras/bb6a06076a380f50e1796ff23f168746.mp4?t=1764371847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot - Define your descension with gear that will inform your playthrough and experiences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/extras/d10b0b0d09a40bb83b5fa628199b60f4.poster.avif?t=1764371847\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/extras/d10b0b0d09a40bb83b5fa628199b60f4.webm?t=1764371847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/extras/d10b0b0d09a40bb83b5fa628199b60f4.mp4?t=1764371847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433390?t=1764371847","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433390?t=1764371847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/681836d105c36f770e7e3ab3926c2bad13ab7c7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764371847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433390/681836d105c36f770e7e3ab3926c2bad13ab7c7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764371847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4068620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world beneath the surface lurks a variety of monsters waiting for the next adventurer to stumble down. Fight your way back, leveling up your character with unique abilities each run and cash out on all the loot that would hinder your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"